# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# How this repo is built: this is open hardware, not a pure-software repo.
#
#   - Design source (primary): KiCad schematics (*.kicad_sch = KiCad
#     Schematic) + PCB layout (*.kicad_pcb = KiCad Layout) for the Lamoka1/2.
#   - Firmware: PIE, the Arduino UI sketch (*.ino = C++) under SOFTWARE/.
#   - Tooling: a small Python helper for the 3D switch model.
#   - Docs: Markdown (excluded from language stats by default).
#   - Generated output: fab/BOM files exported from KiCad.
#
# GitHub's Linguist classifies KiCad files as "data", which it EXCLUDES from
# the language stats. Without the linguist-detectable lines below, GitHub
# shows this repo as "C++ 100%" from the one firmware sketch, even though
# ~95% of the bytes are KiCad design. With them, the bar reads KiCad
# (design) + C++ (firmware). See github-linguist/linguist docs/overrides.md.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Hardware design source: make the KiCad files count ---
*.kicad_sch linguist-detectable
*.kicad_pcb linguist-detectable
*.kicad_sym linguist-detectable
*.kicad_mod linguist-detectable
*.kicad_wks linguist-detectable
*.sch       linguist-detectable

# KiCad project files are JSON (config, not design source). Highlight as
# JSON but keep out of the language stats.
*.kicad_pro linguist-language=JSON

# --- Firmware (the only true C++; already the Linguist default) ---
*.ino linguist-language=C++

# --- Tooling ---
*.py linguist-language=Python

# --- Generated output: keep the chart on source, not exports ---

# Interactive BOMs are generated HTML — without this GitHub labels the repo "HTML"
*.html linguist-generated=true

# Manufacturing output (Gerbers, drill, job files, ERC/DRC reports)
*.gbr linguist-generated=true
*.gbrjob linguist-generated=true
*.drl linguist-generated=true
*.rpt linguist-generated=true
*.job linguist-generated=true

# Fab / vendor order exports (generated snapshots, keeps diffs clean)
*.csv linguist-generated=true
*.tsv linguist-generated=true
*.xls linguist-generated=true
*.xlsx linguist-generated=true

# KiCad session lock files (per-session state, never source)
*.lck linguist-generated=true
